---
module: salesforce
func_id: map-contact
---

***conformance tests***

# map-full-contact
:SalesforceContactMapping: maps a `ContactRecord` of :SalesforceRestAPI: with `Id` `003000000000001AAA`, `Name` `Ada Lovelace`, `Email` ` Ada@Example.COM `, `Title` `Engineer`, `Account` with `Name` `Analytical Engines`, and `attributes` of `type` `Contact` to a :Contact:.
- `provider_id` is `salesforce`, `external_id` is `003000000000001AAA`, `full_name` is `Ada Lovelace`.
- `primary_email` is `ada@example.com`, `job_title` is `Engineer`, `company_name` is `Analytical Engines`.
- `custom_fields` is `{}`.

# name-from-parts
:SalesforceContactMapping: maps a `ContactRecord` of :SalesforceRestAPI: with a `null` `Name`, `FirstName` `Ada` and `LastName` `Lovelace` to a :Contact:.
- `full_name` is `Ada Lovelace`.

# null-account
:SalesforceContactMapping: maps a `ContactRecord` of :SalesforceRestAPI: with `Account` `null` to a :Contact:.
- `company_name` is `null`.

# select-custom-fields
:SalesforceContactMapping: maps a `ContactRecord` of :SalesforceRestAPI: with `Department` `Research`, `LeadSource` `Web`, `attributes` and an `Account` object to a :Contact:.
- `custom_fields` is `{"Department": "Research", "LeadSource": "Web"}`.

***acceptance tests***
